<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada to auction C$1.5 bln 7-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada to auction C$1.5 bln 7-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada plans to auction on November 27 C$1.5 billion of 7-day treasury bills due December 5, 1996, the central bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bills will be delivered on November 28, the Bank of Canada said.</p>
<p>The tender is subject to standard auction terms. Results of the tender will be released at 1130 EST/1630 GMT on November 27.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416-941-8100</p>
</text>
